<title>SPAIN: POLL-Banesto H1 net attributable seen up 20.7 pct.</title>
<headline>POLL-Banesto H1 net attributable seen up 20.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forecasts for first-half results for Spain's Banco Espanol de Credito (Banesto).</p>
<p>(in billions of pesetas).</p>
<p>				   H1 97	  H1 96	 RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income    69.16	  64.49    68.33-70.00</p>
<p>    Operating income	 25.11	  21.37    24.24-27.57</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 17.44	  14.45    16.50-18.60</p>
<p>NOTE - The group could release results today or Monday.</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Benito y Monjardin, Inverban, AB Asesores, Ahorro Corp. Financiero, Beta Capital.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
